+  15 Feb 2037, 4.500% 15 May 2038, 4.375% 15 Nov 2039, 4.250% 15 Nov 2040, 3.125% 15 Nov 2041; iBond funds 15 Dec
+  2032-36, assumed): each coupon reinvested to its own bond's maturity; -2pt for good from 2 Jan 2027: T-bonds $13.5k when
+  due ($10.5k in 2033 $); with iBond income $19.8k ($16.4k). Next-payment design: $4.8k ($4.6k), iBond income not
+  modelled. Laura's kept half (25% sail, `keel/scripts/sail_mc.py`, J.P. Morgan 2026 LTCMA AC World 7.00% / 16.78%,
+  200,000 paths) covers $16.4k in 91.1% of paths; the whole sail in 100%. Joint case: half $12.0k; $4.4k from the gift.
+- Caplet's figure reproduced with its own method (`keel/library/ips_numbers_2026-10/ips_numbers.py`): $21,027 on 23 Oct.
